The policies in this directory are generated by tools/cis-import from the
goss-based STIG audit content of the Ansible Lockdown project
(https://github.com/ansible-lockdown), repositories *-STIG-Audit. The commands
and expected results of the checks are derived from that content, which is
distributed under the MIT license below.

Rule titles, STIG IDs, vulnerability IDs, CCIs and NIST mappings come from the
Security Technical Implementation Guides published by the US Defense
Information Systems Agency (DISA). checkmate is not affiliated with or
endorsed by DISA or the US Department of Defense.

